  "description": "MIGZEK crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 Dy4 F36 N8 O20. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.823-3.924 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.38-110.59°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Dy4.",
